  "concept": {
    "zh": "两队巡逻 · 路线与 CPU 共用 19 回合",
    "en": "Two patrols · 19 turns shared by travel and CPU"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "19 回合内收齐两块电池、让 CPU 停机并在内存地址 2 留下 21，最后停在出口。移动、拾取和 CPU 单步各花 1 回合，每回合两台巡逻机器人各沿自己的路线前进一步。巡逻表从第 0 回合的位置开始，走完从头循环。移动前后与巡逻机器人同格都会失败。",
    "en": "In 19 turns, recover both batteries, halt the CPU with 21 at memory address 2, and finish at the exit. A move, pickup, or CPU step costs one turn and advances both patrols. The first position in each patrol route is its turn-zero position. Routes repeat. Sharing a tile with a patrol before or after it moves ends the run."
  },
